  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 15640,
      "text": "Now turn to section 2 on page 3."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 15640,
      "endMs": 17840,
      "text": "Section 2."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 17840,
      "endMs": 24200,
      "text": "You will hear an accommodation agent telling a student about different accommodation options."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 24200,
      "endMs": 50920,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14 on page 3."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 50920,
      "endMs": 58520,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 58520,
      "endMs": 59520,
      "text": "Agent: Hello."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 59520,
      "endMs": 60520,
      "text": "Can I help?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 60520,
      "endMs": 61520,
      "text": "Student: Yes."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 61520,
      "endMs": 62520,
      "text": "I'm looking for accommodation."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 62520,
      "endMs": 66760,
      "text": "I'm a student in my second year at the college and I wanted to rent something from"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 66760,
      "endMs": 69120,
      "text": "September for myself and a friend."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 69120,
      "endMs": 72760,
      "text": "Agent: Well, we've got several choices at the moment."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 72760,
      "endMs": 78160,
      "text": "Near the college we've got a flat, a house, or there's a student hostel, all at about"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 78160,
      "endMs": 79760,
      "text": "the same rent."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 79760,
      "endMs": 84480,
      "text": "But of course they all have different features and different things included in the rent."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 84480,
      "endMs": 88160,
      "text": "The properties don't all have gardens I'm afraid."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 88160,
      "endMs": 92160,
      "text": "The house is quite small, not much space around it."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 92160,
      "endMs": 96560,
      "text": "It has got a bit of space at the back, but I wouldn't call it a garden."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 96560,
      "endMs": 101200,
      "text": "The hostel is part of a city development, so there's no space for a garden."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 101200,
      "endMs": 105600,
      "text": "But the flat has a communal garden that is shared by all the tenants."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 105600,
      "endMs": 110400,
      "text": "I would say that that's very good value for the price."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 110400,
      "endMs": 111680,
      "text": "Have you got a car?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 111680,
      "endMs": 113680,
      "text": "Student: Yes."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 113680,
      "endMs": 119200,
      "text": "Agent: There are garages around the corner from the house, but you have to rent those separately"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 119200,
      "endMs": 122200,
      "text": "and they might not be available."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 122200,
      "endMs": 127360,
      "text": "But each flat is allotted a garage in the grounds as part of the deal."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 127360,
      "endMs": 131320,
      "text": "The hostel doesn't have the space I'm afraid."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 131320,
      "endMs": 135120,
      "text": "I guess you might also want to know about security as well."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 135120,
      "endMs": 138480,
      "text": "The house is the only one which is alarmed."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 138480,
      "endMs": 144680,
      "text": "The flats and the hostel are accessed through a main door which has an intercom for visitors."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 144680,
      "endMs": 147280,
      "text": "So they're quite safe."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 147280,
      "endMs": 149800,
      "text": "Now they are all furnished."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 149800,
      "endMs": 153800,
      "text": "The stuff in the flats quite modern looking, which most people like."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 153800,
      "endMs": 157520,
      "text": "And it's in quite good condition considering the use it's had."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 157520,
      "endMs": 161880,
      "text": "All the furniture and fittings in the house have just been replaced after the last tenants"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 161880,
      "endMs": 162880,
      "text": "left."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 162880,
      "endMs": 165160,
      "text": "There'll be an excellent condition."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 165160,
      "endMs": 173800,
      "text": "And the furniture in the hostel is okay, but it's about what you'd expect really."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 173800,
      "endMs": 179080,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 15"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 179080,
      "endMs": 181480,
      "text": "to 20 on page 4."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 192880,
      "endMs": 218960,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 218960,
      "endMs": 222240,
      "text": "Student: Well I think I'd better go and look at them all."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 222240,
      "endMs": 223240,
      "text": "Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 223240,
      "endMs": 224240,
      "text": "Agent: Here."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 224240,
      "endMs": 226240,
      "text": "Let me show you on the map."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 226240,
      "endMs": 227240,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 227240,
      "endMs": 234000,
      "text": "We're here in the accommodation agency on the High Street facing North."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 234000,
      "endMs": 236880,
      "text": "Directly opposite us is the bank, okay?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 236880,
      "endMs": 242840,
      "text": "If you stay on this side of the road and walk towards West Street, the house is not that"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 242840,
      "endMs": 244720,
      "text": "far."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 244720,
      "endMs": 249400,
      "text": "It's next but one to the swimming pool just before West Street."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 249400,
      "endMs": 253160,
      "text": "It's very convenient because it's near the shops."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 253160,
      "endMs": 260400,
      "text": "The hostel is on the corner of West Street and St Anne's Road near the roundabout."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 260400,
      "endMs": 265600,
      "text": "It's not a very wonderful building but it's nice and close to the college."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 265600,
      "endMs": 271400,
      "text": "The flat is a bit of a walk but it's in very nice surroundings."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 271400,
      "endMs": 277520,
      "text": "To get to the flat, you go down West Street towards the centre of the city and the building"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 277520,
      "endMs": 282640,
      "text": "is on the corner just before the first turning on the left."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 282640,
      "endMs": 287520,
      "text": "Although we're a bit outside the city centre, the facilities aren't bad."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 287520,
      "endMs": 290720,
      "text": "There's a post office just round the corner from here."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 290720,
      "endMs": 296560,
      "text": "You go down the High Street and turn right into West Street and it's on your right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 296560,
      "endMs": 301000,
      "text": "Or if you want to go to the city centre, you could get the bus from here at just a few"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 301000,
      "endMs": 304840,
      "text": "metres down the road from the agency going east."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 304840,
      "endMs": 309840,
      "text": "You don't even need to cross the road."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 309840,
      "endMs": 312680,
      "text": "That is the end of section 2."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 312680,
      "endMs": 315360,
      "text": "You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    }
  ],
